Things to Do for the Project
----------------------------

[ ] Look at the disassembly and discern where the table for
    battled trainers is kept, and how those event flags are
    stored in the save file.

[ ] I know, from a YouTube video, that the Pokedex table is
    204 (19*8*2) bits long in Gen 1: 152 bits for Seen flags,
    and 152 bits for Caught flags.  Where are these flags,
    and how are they stored?  And how hard would it be to
    set these flags and recalculate the checksum accordingly?

[ ] Add an option to set the correct checksum if the file has
    been altered in any way.
